## OpenVPN UCI configuration
## /etc/config/openvpn
##
## Each 'config openvpn <name>' section maps to one OpenVPN instance.
## Set enabled=1 and either point to a .conf file or inline all options.
##
## Example – TROPIC01 PKCS#11 client using the pre-installed template:
##
## config openvpn 'tropic01_client'
##         option enabled    1
##         option config     '/etc/openvpn/tropic01-pkcs11-client.conf'
##
## On boot the init script reads every enabled section and launches a
## dedicated openvpn process for each one.
